* Symbols defined with -a= in conditionals before the psect (ifdef, ifne of the value): known
* there, as r68 takes them. a0f6d83 made them set symbols, which a use before their last set
* takes as SYM__final, defined at the end: ifdef was silently false (dc.w Val_y an undefined
* symbol), ifne "non-constant expression".
* fixed: FIXME
* options: -dialect=c32 -a=Flag_x -a=Num_n=3
* expect text: 0005 0007
 ifdef Flag_x
Val_y equ 5
 endc
 ifne Num_n-3
Val_z equ 6
 else
Val_z equ 7
 endc
 psect a_cond,0,0,0,0,0
 dc.w Val_y
 dc.w Val_z
 ends
